# Release signing material must NEVER live in this repo - the real keystore
# and keystore.properties live outside it entirely (see app/build.gradle.kts'
# releaseKeystorePropertiesPath). These patterns are defense-in-depth only,
# in case either ever ends up here by mistake.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties

# Scratch/debug artifacts from ad-hoc development sessions - not part of the
